  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Grill the corn on the cob for 10-12 minutes, turning every 2 minutes, until lightly charred.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the orange juice, mayonnaise, chili powder, paprika, salt, and pepper.",
    "Once the corn is cool enough to handle, brush the orange juice mixture evenly onto each ear of corn.",
    "Sprinkle the cotija cheese and orange zest over the corn.",
    "Fold the foil over the corn to create a packet and grill for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Remove the corn from the grill and sprinkle with chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve the elote hot, with any remaining orange juice mixture on the side."
  ],
